     1	"""Read-only Git access for ingestion.
     2	
     3	Uses the Git CLI — the project's documented prerequisite (roadmap §3, docs/setup.md) — and
     4	reads committed objects, never the working tree. Only the operations ingestion needs are
     5	exposed; there is no write path.
     6	
     7	Paths and blob contents are treated as untrusted input: paths come from ``git ls-tree -z`` and
     8	object expressions are terminated with ``--end-of-options`` so a repository cannot smuggle a
