     1	#!/usr/bin/env python3
     2	"""Build the deterministic Git histories for the external-style fixtures.
     3	
     4	Why a builder: the portable path must index a *pinned commit in a Git repository*, not a directory
     5	of files. The two fixtures under ``fixtures/external-*/tree`` are ordinary projects that never
     6	adopted CTA conventions; this script materializes them as real repositories with fixed identities,
     7	dates, messages, and tags so every machine produces the same SHAs.
     8	
     9	This script writes only under the destination directory. It never touches the fixture sources and
    10	never runs anything from the built repository.
    11	
    12	    uv run --project backend python tools/external_fixture.py build --dest /tmp/cta-external
    13	    uv run --project backend python tools/external_fixture.py show-refs --dest /tmp/cta-external
    14	"""
